st", "registered_intervention_count": 5, "radius": "For each observed batch, sqrt(log(2*m/alpha)/(2*n)), where m is the count of ALL registered interventions, including unobserved ones.", "compatibility": "A family is compatible if at least one of its nuisance profiles satisfies abs(profile[experiment] - following_wrong_leader/n) <= radius for EVERY observed batch.", "claim": "Select a family only when exactly one registered family is compatible. Otherwise selected must be null. A singleton is conditional on the registered set and assumptions; it does not establish mechanism completeness in reality."}, "previous_attempts": [{"round": 0, "raw_output": "{
